# BioAMLA Datasets

https://github.com/jmcmeen/bioamla-datasets

## Metadata and documentation

The metadata files (`metadata.csv`, `dataset.json`), READMEs, recipes and
templates in this repository are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Credit "BioAMLA Datasets,
https://github.com/jmcmeen/bioamla-datasets" when you reuse them.

## Audio

Audio clips are not covered by the licence above. Each clip keeps the
licence of its original recording, recorded per clip in that dataset's
`metadata.csv` (`attr_lic`, with the recordist in `attr_id` and the source
in `attr_url`) and summarised in that dataset's own `LICENSE` file:

- `datasets/esc-50/LICENSE`: ESC-50, CC BY-NC 3.0 overall, per-clip Freesound licences
- `datasets/scp-frogs-inat-v1/LICENSE`: iNaturalist recordings, CC BY-NC / CC BY / CC0 per clip

Datasets whose audio is hosted elsewhere (Hugging Face, Google Drive) state
their licence in their README.
